<title>CHILE: Chile's IANSA net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's IANSA net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean foodmaker Industria Azucarera Nacional SA (IANSA) reported the following results last year.</p>
<p>			    1996		 1995</p>
<p> Net earnings	   18.62		20.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     17.55		20.40</p>
<p> Non-operating profit  2.69		 2.88</p>
<p> Revenues		 219.39	     216.19</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos. ((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
